This bumps the traust-contracts pin from `e7a794d` to `81f8fbd`, the merge commit of traust-contracts#150. That PR tightens the pqc-portfolio view contract:

- a product-scoped view must have an empty product index;
- a scope with a null `product_id` must be the only scope;
- `clock_items`, `remediations` and `locations` are never null.

`PqcPortfolioView` already builds these shapes. The full suite passes against the stricter contract (SQLite: 14,299 passed).

